            ("Who edited Irreverent?", "Carine Roitfeld created the book with Olivier Zahm and Alex Wiederin, who are credited as its editors."),
            ("Who is Carine Roitfeld?", "Carine Roitfeld is a French fashion editor and stylist who was editor-in-chief of Vogue Paris from 2001 to 2011 and launched CR Fashion Book in 2012."),
